WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Health benefits

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,400
You have as much as you want

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,800
I need at least a hundred packs

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,800
You have so much space

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Can you take this? Don't worry, I will find a way.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,000
Do you have anything else to sell in bulk?

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
For example, a packed lunch, breakfast, etc. Why?

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,400
Do you know we were hungry in front of you?

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,000
These foods can save our lives

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Guests, please don't be anxious.

11
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,000
Food in the breakfast room cannot be sold

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,800
But the lunch boxes in the lobby can be taken away

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,400
The limit of how many boxes you can buy at one time is twenty boxes

14
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,600
but for other customers

15
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:28,800
You can only buy fifteen boxes

16
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,800
And each box requires

17
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,600
Pay an additional five chicken cents takeaway fee

18
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,200
Such a precious thing

19
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,400
So sugary and yellow

20
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,800
Put it under the eyes of everyone

21
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Aren't you afraid of being robbed?

22
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,100
They dare not

23
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,040
Is your mind full of tofu?

24
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:55,690
last few years

25
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:57,890
I haven't even taught you how to speak well.

26
00:00:58,090 --> 00:01:00,380
Eat my food, drink my food, live in my food

27
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:02,380
How dare you say anything to me?
